WEBVTT

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:15.190
Chief, I brought Number 88.

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:25.270
Grandpa.

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:28.530
He was caught for illegal trespassing?

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:32.110
That's right.  The same as me.

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:34.230
Isn't it strange?

00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:37.480
The investigation was completed 
before he was brought here.

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:40.420
So what are they investigating now?

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:47.390
Chief Takasu is a tough guy.  I 
have a bad feeling about this.

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:51.120
Let me start off by saying this:

00:00:51.970 --> 00:00:55.170
I hate the people of Satellite.

00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:03.910
In truth, I don't like touching them either!

00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:09.150
Inspect him!

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:12.560
Thoroughly.

00:01:35.580 --> 00:01:40.870
No matter how far apart we 
are, we can't be stopped

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:45.870
That's deeply engraved into us

00:01:45.990 --> 00:01:54.360
So don't be afraid of getting hurt

00:01:56.800 --> 00:02:00.370
Break through even further

00:02:00.740 --> 00:02:05.880
While carrying you beliefs in your heart

00:02:07.340 --> 00:02:13.030
There's always only one truth

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:16.920
So feel the voice of your heart

00:02:18.140 --> 00:02:21.710
With your unwavering emotions

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:27.810
Seize the signs of tomorrow

00:02:57.330 --> 00:03:03.210
Unfulfilled Soul The Signer 
and the Legendary Dragon

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:34.760
Had enough already?

00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:42.410
A citizen of Satellite isn't 
worthy of a D-Wheel or a deck.

00:03:43.440 --> 00:03:48.580
Your D-Wheel and deck are both property 
of the Public Maintenance Department.

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:53.330
It seems the Director has an 
interest in your belongings.

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:58.500
They're being thoroughly inspected 
in the security vault.

00:04:06.090 --> 00:04:11.840
A few moments ago, we received 
information from the detention center.

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:32.440
So far, Chief Takasu has been unable to 
confirm that this man from Satellite is a Signer.

00:04:32.590 --> 00:04:36.320
He will continue to research and observe.

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:40.750
Did you tell the King everything?

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:47.610
If I didn't reveal everything, I would 
have failed to calm down the King.

00:04:47.610 --> 00:04:50.870
This is becoming interesting.

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:53.910
Yes.

00:04:54.010 --> 00:04:56.860
Next is the man from Satellite.

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:58.940
I will meet him.

00:05:08.560 --> 00:05:11.180
Are you okay, bro?

00:05:13.970 --> 00:05:17.580
Pull yourself together.  
What did they do to you?

00:05:18.430 --> 00:05:20.770
They were looking for a mark.

00:05:20.770 --> 00:05:22.260
A mark?

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:27.160
When the Crimson Dragon appeared, it 
appeared on my arm and then vanished.

00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:29.610
What do you mean, bro?

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:38.190
Bro, are you a Signer?

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:39.580
Signer?

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:45.500
When I was wandering in South America, I 
heard about the legend of the people of the stars.

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:49.840
Signer is a word that came up in that legend.

00:05:51.180 --> 00:05:55.210
According to the legend of the people of 
the stars, the Crimson Dragon is their god.

00:05:55.210 --> 00:06:00.650
The people who summon it have the mark 
of the dragon and are known as Signers.

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:03.590
There are five Signers.

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:07.760
Each controls a dragon that 
can draw out its power.

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:12.930
In other words, there are five 
Signers and five dragons.

00:06:13.340 --> 00:06:15.360
Five dragons?

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:30.070
The five dragons continue to live throughout 
the generations and change their appearances.

00:06:30.070 --> 00:06:33.070
Hey, wait.  That means…

00:06:33.220 --> 00:06:35.610
Bro, your dragon!

00:06:37.740 --> 00:06:41.090
If that card is one of them...

00:06:41.090 --> 00:06:45.060
Card?  The dragons currently live as cards?

00:06:45.060 --> 00:06:47.330
I want to see that card.

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:48.890
I don't have the card.

00:06:50.060 --> 00:06:53.790
How frustrating!  I want to see that card!

00:06:53.790 --> 00:06:57.060
But it's strange.

00:06:57.060 --> 00:07:01.130
Why would the detention guards 
be interested about this?

00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:09.490
You are the chosen one of the stars.

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:14.760
What do you want?

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:18.880
The data on your opponent in 
tomorrow's duel has arrived.

00:07:18.880 --> 00:07:21.360
Please look it over.

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:24.320
How do I look right now?

00:07:24.320 --> 00:07:26.260
Clearly you are the King of Duelists.

00:07:26.260 --> 00:07:27.420
You're wrong!

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:29.790
My undefeated legend has already ended.

00:07:29.790 --> 00:07:31.540
I lost to him.

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:33.830
I am not the King!

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:41.350
You're wrong.  Master Atlas, 
you must be the King.

00:07:41.590 --> 00:07:43.120
I must?

00:07:43.180 --> 00:07:47.200
If I continue to feel like I 
do right now, I can't duel!

00:07:56.360 --> 00:07:59.640
Am I the clown?

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:15.290
Attention!

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:19.100
For today's rehab lesson, we 
invited Director Rex Godwin

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:22.390
of the Neo Domino City Public 
Maintenance Department.

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:27.210
Open your hearts and listen to his 
talk about public maintenance!

00:08:41.490 --> 00:08:47.820
Everybody listen!  The moment has 
arrived for today's most exciting show!

00:08:47.820 --> 00:08:51.090
Let's welcome the challenger 
who will face the King.

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:56.690
He has boldly challenged the King 
in order to get his revenge!

00:08:57.310 --> 00:09:01.540
Your current appearance suits 
you best, Master Atlas.

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:05.320
Thank you for accepting today's duel.

00:09:07.950 --> 00:09:10.320
Is the director watching?

00:09:10.510 --> 00:09:12.960
He went to the detention center today.

00:09:21.530 --> 00:09:27.760
C'mon, the fire revenger Mukuro Enjo!

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:33.590
Today, I will smash the King!

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:39.570
I've assembled the most powerful 
deck!  I will become the next King!

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:59.920
Will his undefeated legend 
finally come to an end?

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:05.790
Show us your skills again today, 
King of Duelists Jack Atlas!

00:10:13.640 --> 00:10:17.390
There is only one King, and it's me!

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:21.020
Today's challenger is different 
than the ones before!

00:10:21.020 --> 00:10:25.760
He reconstructed his deck after 
his previous duel with the King!

00:10:25.760 --> 00:10:28.840
How will the King counteract it?

00:10:31.760 --> 00:10:35.620
They are all expecting the duel of a King.

00:10:35.720 --> 00:10:38.690
Jack!  Jack!  Jack!

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:51.850
The King smiles happily!  He's fully 
prepared to face the challenger!

00:10:52.730 --> 00:10:57.090
Standing here among the cheers and events...

00:10:57.090 --> 00:11:00.150
It's never felt so pointless before.

00:11:01.670 --> 00:11:05.970
Will you witness the birth of a new King?

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:13.780
It's about time for the duel!  Set 
on the field spell Speed World!

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:18.160
Duel mode on.  Autopilot standby.

00:11:23.980 --> 00:11:28.450
The battle of the century is 
about to begin.  Who will win?

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:32.660
Riding Duel acceleration!

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:35.260
The King goes first!

00:11:35.470 --> 00:11:37.780
My turn.  I draw!

00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:41.390
I summon Dark Resonator in defense position!

00:11:41.950 --> 00:11:46.580
The King summoned the Level 3 
Tuner Monster Dark Resonator!

00:11:46.580 --> 00:11:51.530
Once a turn, this card cannot 
be destroyed in battle!

00:11:51.530 --> 00:11:54.770
So you brought out a Tuner.

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:57.810
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:11:58.010 --> 00:12:03.020
Will those two set cards lead 
to an incredible highlight?

00:12:03.020 --> 00:12:04.900
I'm looking forward to it!

00:12:05.710 --> 00:12:12.030
There is a big reason why I 
separated the two groups of people

00:12:12.030 --> 00:12:15.330
between Neo Domino City and Satellite.

00:12:15.370 --> 00:12:20.450
The two worlds complement one another 
in order to promote development.

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:25.340
The people who live at Satellite 
are Satellite citizens,

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:30.340
and the people who live at Neo Domino 
City are Neo Domino City citizens.

00:12:30.340 --> 00:12:34.790
There's a reason why this is necessary.

00:12:34.930 --> 00:12:42.410
If you leave Satellite, then the 
order of the world is disturbed.

00:12:42.910 --> 00:12:50.230
One person's reckless actions can result in 
causing trouble for his friends and acquaintances.

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:55.120
At times, it may bring pain.

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:15.000
It's my turn!

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:20.060
King, check out my super revenge deck!

00:13:20.870 --> 00:13:22.170
I draw!

00:13:23.130 --> 00:13:26.040
I'll steadily apply the pressure, King!

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:31.130
It's the same thing you do so well.  
I'll show you that I can do it too!

00:13:31.130 --> 00:13:34.510
I send Skull Conductor to the 
graveyard and activate its effect!

00:13:34.510 --> 00:13:39.010
I can Special Summon two Zombie-Type 
monsters in faceup defense position

00:13:39.010 --> 00:13:42.700
from my hand whose combined 
attack points equal 2000!

00:13:43.180 --> 00:13:45.770
Come, Burning Skullheads!

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:50.930
There it is!  Two Burning 
Skullheads have appeared!

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:59.200
When Burning Skullhead is successfully special 
summoned, the opponent takes 1000 points of damage!

00:13:59.260 --> 00:14:01.950
Since two were summoned simultaneously, 
you take 2000 points of damage!

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:03.860
Hell Burning!

00:14:09.150 --> 00:14:10.280
Jack!

00:14:10.940 --> 00:14:13.480
The King has already taken big damage!

00:14:13.510 --> 00:14:15.860
There's still more!

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:21.390
I release the two Burning Skullheads 
to Advance Summon Skull Flame!

00:14:24.180 --> 00:14:26.110
What a bold development!

00:14:26.110 --> 00:14:28.960
If he chooses not to attack with Skull Flame,

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:32.960
he can Special Summon one Burning 
Skullhead from his hand.

00:14:32.960 --> 00:14:34.560
But will he do so?

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:38.600
From my hand, I Special 
Summon Burning Skullhead!

00:14:39.820 --> 00:14:45.420
He didn't betray our expectations!   The 
third Burning Skullhead has appeared!

00:14:45.470 --> 00:14:47.620
Hell Burning!

00:14:51.890 --> 00:14:53.680
There's great turmoil from the beginning!

00:14:53.680 --> 00:14:58.570
By the second turn, the King 
only has 1000 life points left!

00:14:58.590 --> 00:15:00.440
Do you understand now?

00:15:00.440 --> 00:15:02.480
This is the power of my revenge deck!

00:15:02.480 --> 00:15:07.070
It has a scary combo where I defeat 
you with consecutive monster effects!

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:11.980
As long as Skull Flame is on the 
field, instead of drawing normally,

00:15:11.980 --> 00:15:16.470
I can add one Burning Skullhead 
in my graveyard to my hand.

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:19.130
Then due to Skull Flame's monster effect,

00:15:19.130 --> 00:15:22.740
I can Special Summon Burning 
Skullhead from my hand.

00:15:22.740 --> 00:15:28.130
That means I can summon 
Burning Skullhead every turn!

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:37.150
On the next turn, if I Special Summon Burning 
Skullhead, the King's life points become zero!

00:15:37.150 --> 00:15:41.490
That means I will be the 
new King of Duelists!

00:15:41.490 --> 00:15:45.820
The challenger Mukuro Enjo 
has declared victory!

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:50.600
You call this a duel?

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:53.470
You were just lucky.

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:57.490
This wasn't good enough 
to be considered a duel!

00:15:59.320 --> 00:16:02.940
And that concludes the 
Director's training speech.

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:05.580
Return to your rooms immediately!

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:13.050
Number 88, you stay here.

00:16:16.190 --> 00:16:17.970
Be careful.

00:16:23.220 --> 00:16:27.950
The King is currently 
dueling at that stadium.

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:29.630
So what?

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:32.210
Watch your mouth!

00:16:32.420 --> 00:16:34.610
It's fine.

00:16:36.650 --> 00:16:39.560
What do you want to know about me?

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:42.050
Everything.

00:16:43.880 --> 00:16:47.770
Where did the mark go?

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:51.540
Why does the Public Maintenance 
Department care about that?

00:16:51.630 --> 00:16:54.570
Because it relates to public maintenance.

00:16:56.120 --> 00:16:57.670
What are you thinking about?

00:16:57.990 --> 00:17:01.170
In that speech you gave, 
what did you mean by pain?

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:05.350
I also don't know what you're thinking about.

00:17:05.350 --> 00:17:11.850
I just wanted to talk about the relationship 
between Neo Domino City and Satellite.

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:15.990
Don't touch my friends. They 
have nothing to do with this.

00:17:16.170 --> 00:17:18.040
Really?

00:17:18.400 --> 00:17:20.440
Who are you?

00:17:20.630 --> 00:17:27.240
I'm just a person who dreams of Neo Domino 
City's development and peace in the world.

00:17:27.510 --> 00:17:30.760
However, since I must deal with reality,

00:17:30.760 --> 00:17:36.270
I'm willing to sacrifice one side 
to ensure the survival of the other.

00:17:36.370 --> 00:17:38.240
Sacrifice?

00:17:38.830 --> 00:17:41.040
It's just an example.

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:47.000
Let's pay attention to the King's turn!

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:54.670
I release Dark Resonator to 
Advance Summon Big Piece Golem!

00:17:58.790 --> 00:18:00.900
Will he use his set card?

00:18:00.900 --> 00:18:03.450
Whatever you do is pointless!  
Stop struggling!

00:18:03.450 --> 00:18:06.570
I activate the trap card Revival Gift!

00:18:06.570 --> 00:18:14.100
The trap card Revival Gift lets him Special 
Summon one Tuner Monster from his graveyard!

00:18:14.100 --> 00:18:19.090
From my graveyard, I Special Summon 
the Tuner Monster Dark Resonator!

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:20.940
And then...

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:26.420
Why are they on my field?

00:18:26.420 --> 00:18:29.390
This is the surprising 
effect of Revival Gift!

00:18:29.390 --> 00:18:35.390
It Special Summons two Gift Fiend 
Tokens on the opponent's field!

00:18:35.390 --> 00:18:40.330
But looking at the situation, that effect 
looks like a negative for the King.

00:18:40.330 --> 00:18:43.230
What is the King planning?

00:18:43.230 --> 00:18:48.530
Level 3 Dark Resonator tunes 
Level 5 Big Piece Golem!

00:18:48.530 --> 00:18:54.740
The pulse of the King now forms a line 
here!  Witness the power of the rumbling heavens!

00:18:55.010 --> 00:18:57.150
Synchro Summon!

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:58.450
My soul!

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:01.070
Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:19:04.090 --> 00:19:08.880
It finally arrived!  The King's 
mightiest ace Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:12.710
It is so beautiful that the entire 
stadium swallows its breath!

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:14.770
It arrived!

00:19:14.770 --> 00:19:16.420
Battle!  Go!

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:19.770
Absolute Powerforce!

00:19:20.990 --> 00:19:25.070
Due to the attack, Gift Fiend 
Tokens have been destroyed!

00:19:25.070 --> 00:19:28.440
That's Red Dragon Archfiend's monster effect!

00:19:28.440 --> 00:19:32.340
When it attacks a monster in 
defense position on the field,

00:19:32.340 --> 00:19:36.710
all monsters in defense position on 
the opponent's field are destroyed!

00:19:38.350 --> 00:19:39.890
I activate my trap card!

00:19:39.890 --> 00:19:41.900
Lineage of Destruction.

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:44.540
The King has shown his violent fangs!

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:51.360
With Lineage of Destruction, for ever 
monster in defense position that was destroyed,

00:19:51.360 --> 00:19:53.560
the target monster can attack again!

00:19:55.540 --> 00:19:58.990
I destroyed three monsters in 
defense position this turn.

00:19:58.990 --> 00:20:02.280
Therefore, it can attack 
an additional three times!

00:20:02.280 --> 00:20:05.380
Three additional attacks?  No way!

00:20:05.380 --> 00:20:08.060
Witness the power of the King!

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:12.970
Finish him, Red Dragon Archfiend!  
Absolute Powerforce!

00:20:18.890 --> 00:20:21.640
There is nothing you can do to escape!

00:20:21.640 --> 00:20:26.130
You have the honor of being 
attacked by Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:31.030
Scorching Crimson Hellflare!

00:20:33.590 --> 00:20:38.210
The challenger's life points have 
instantly decreased by 3000 points!

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:41.890
This will be the final attack!

00:20:41.890 --> 00:20:46.180
Didn't you say that you would 
become the King on the next turn?

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:48.390
Well, this is reality!

00:20:49.410 --> 00:20:51.470
Kneel before the King!

00:20:51.470 --> 00:20:54.710
Absolute Powerforce!

00:20:54.710 --> 00:20:57.390
No way!

00:21:06.430 --> 00:21:09.710
While you were bragging about 
your consecutive attacks,

00:21:09.710 --> 00:21:12.110
you were unable to finish 
me during your own turn.

00:21:12.480 --> 00:21:15.950
You don't have the right 
to challenge the King!

00:21:18.260 --> 00:21:19.820
It's over!

00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:22.150
The King was too strong!

00:21:22.150 --> 00:21:26.150
The breathtaking counterattack made 
this greater than his previous duels!

00:21:26.150 --> 00:21:27.980
He is powerful and invincible!

00:21:27.980 --> 00:21:31.590
He has once again defended 
his undefeated legend!

00:21:32.440 --> 00:21:35.840
There is only one King, and it's me!

00:21:36.200 --> 00:21:43.220
Jack!  Jack!  Jack!

00:21:44.510 --> 00:21:49.410
This pathetic duel can't quench my thirst!

00:22:04.440 --> 00:22:10.020
What can we grasp?  What can we do?

00:22:10.380 --> 00:22:15.410
We'll step forward and find out

00:22:15.790 --> 00:22:21.340
My unstoppable emotions, the 
beating of my passionate heart

00:22:21.500 --> 00:22:26.580
I heard the voice of truth

00:22:26.770 --> 00:22:29.740
After I was hurt, I learned

00:22:32.310 --> 00:22:35.330
Of a place where I can become stronger

00:22:37.280 --> 00:22:42.490
I stack my dreams in my palm

00:22:42.620 --> 00:22:47.890
And I'll someday pass them to you

00:22:48.320 --> 00:22:53.830
Seeking for the signal 
to start, my soul roars

00:22:54.130 --> 00:22:59.170
I will overcome my suffocating 
and mediocre life

00:22:59.730 --> 00:23:05.260
I'll dash and acquire all the bright futures

00:23:05.410 --> 00:23:14.680
Carrying the bonds I believe 
in, I run towards tomorrow
